  "user_id": 22366,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Design a Mapped Object\r\n\r\n**Goal:** You're helping the city shelter redesign its pet listings so lost animals can be reunited with their families and adopted more quickly by displaying clear, focused information on each pet card.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\nUse `.map()` to transform the original API data into a UI-ready object for your card layout.\r\n\r\n1. Select only the fields your UI will display.\r\n\r\n2. Rename keys to match your interface labels.\r\n\r\n3. Reformat values if needed (add units, combine text, simplify).\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
